cal cache and therefore inadvertently preventing shutdown was actually a cache maintenance thread of my own. It tracks buffers used by open files and makes sure idle write streams don't keep huge dangling buffers. Since it sits in a scheduled thread pool executor, I couldn't even manually shut down the thread (to free the thread local cache) without losing the ability to start it back up again or starting it up every time the task runs. So I just absorbed its responsibilities into application threads. Funny how similar it was.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netty/netty/issues/comments/44695939/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"tea-dragon","id":2219887,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMTk4ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2219887?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tea-dragon","html_url":"https://github.com/tea-dragon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tea-dragon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tea-dragon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tea-dragon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tea-dragon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tea-dragon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tea-dragon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tea-dragon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tea-dragon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tea-dragon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":126943627,"node_id":"MDExOkNsb3NlZEV2ZW50MTI2OTQzNjI3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netty/netty/issues/events/126943627","actor":{"login":"trustin","id":173918,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MzkxOA==","avatar_url":"